  "construction": "One-block cyclic stabilizer code: generator X^a Z^b and its 62 cyclic shifts, a(x) = x^30 + x^32, b(x) = x^17 + x^26 + x^36 + x^45 in F_2[x]/(x^62 - 1); a = g p, b = g q with p, q palindromic so that a b* + b a* = 0; k = deg gcd(a, b, x^62 - 1)",
